From 12132656bdefa518040b76b918abcf2e0ef27aed Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: LieppOS <lieppos@local>
Date: Tue, 28 Apr 2026 00:42:42 +0300
Subject: [PATCH] LieppOS uncommitted WIP: frameworks/base
 ro.lieppos.microg_restricted_spoofing

Allow the existing restricted microG signature spoofing path when
either ro.debuggable=1 or ro.lieppos.microg_restricted_spoofing=true,
so user builds keep spoofing enabled without flipping to userdebug.

Scope unchanged: still only com.google.android.gms / com.android.vending,
still gated on the hardcoded NOGAPPS cert.

Change-Id: I63fda64adbb63ca8cd9072831ef2dba03862b2e1
